{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:235a3d3c923a59ff","name":"Improved Sense Surroundings","source":{"id":"source:reference-235a3d3c923a59ff","title":"Improved Sense Surroundings","revision":24331,"timestamp":"2024-10-30T14:50:46Z","sha256":"aad617c94cbfe11d4c0ed2edbf296161977a411bf1e8ac04926300c59157221e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24331","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Improved%20Sense%20Surroundings&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-235a3d3c923a59ff","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," rather than a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Message From the Faculty: Line of Sight"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," require that the target be both within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," and within a certain range. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," Skill can be used to perceive targets despite the presence of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," such as walls and doors or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," such as fog and smoke. By the strictest interpretation of the rules, using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," to ignore penalties to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks does not grant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},"; it merely allows one to perceive the target (just as hearing someone coming around the corner doesn't grant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},".)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, in some situations a Gamemaster may wish to allow a character to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," to gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". If a character has the Improved Sense Surroundings Force Technique, the Gamemaster can allow a character that has perceived a target to also have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to that target, provided that the character used the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sense Surroundings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sense_Surroundings"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," Skill earlier in the character's turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
